  "description": "The Dean Fast is one of the absolute fastest time trial bikes in the world. It incorporates every Ridley aero technology to create a truly unique bike. The Dean Fast's frontal drag is incredibly minimal thanks to meticulous attention paid by our engineers. Its aerodynamic head tube and fully integrated Forza time trial handlebar helps keep airflow clean. Transition from handlebar to frame is incredibly smooth, while wheels are perfectly integrated into the frame. The Dean Fast comes with several dropouts to ensure that your specific rear wheels fit perfectly with the frame every time. The Forza handlebar is a blessing for bike fitters. The armrests and extensions work completely independently of each other to set the perfect seating position.",
